<title>USA: PRI Automation sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>PRI Automation sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>BILLERICA, Mass. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PRI Automation Inc said its board has approved a two-for-one split of its common stock, subject to approval of an increase in its authorized common stock by shareholders at a special meeting on April 22.</p>
<p>The split will be effected by the distribution of a 100-percent stock dividend on May 3, to shareholders of record April 22, PRI said.</p>
<p>It said the shareholders' action would increase the number of shares of authorized common stock to 24 million from 12 million  PRI currently has about 7.8 million shares issued and outstanding.</p>
</text>
